    Step): You can target 1 of those monsters; Special Summon it, and if you do,
    it is treated as a Tuner. During your opponent''s Main Phase: You can send this
    face-up card to the GY; immediately after this effect resolves, Synchro Summon
    using monsters you control as material.'
